{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8034","id":5222711894,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABN0xCVg","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8034","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8034.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8034.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8034","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8034/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8034/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8034/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/5eaa7cebb112e9c7cb9c29d8f470a45c0b6d459a","number":8034,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"id(world): actor-authorized builder install + moderator revoke (design #835 phase 2)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Phase 2 of the design in `doc/2026-11-01_design_id835.md` for #5544 (phase 1 journal gate merged as PR #4535).\n\n- `WorldCommand::RevokeAuthorized` / `InstallProgramAuthorized` take the live `JoinCapability`; the serialized world actor authorizes it (`MODERATOR` / `BUILDER`) at the mutation boundary and derives the audit actor for `Revoked { by }` / `BuilderInstalled { by }`. No caller-supplied actor ID is trusted on this path.\n- Revoke keeps fail-closed in-memory semantics but surfaces a journal-append failure instead of reporting an audited success.\n- Install runs through the existing admin install path with `installed_by` set, preserving the atomic `Committed` + `BuilderInstalled` transaction.\n- `authorize()` fix: `effective_scopes` seeds from `WorldScopes::ALL`, which deliberately excludes the admin authority bits, so `authorize(token, BUILDER|MODERATOR)` could never succeed. `authorize` now seeds the ancestor-chain intersection with all recognized bits (the intersection only removes bits; ceilings, delegation and projections keep the `ALL`-seeded path).\n\nTests: `pkgs/id/tests/world_roles.rs` gains moderator-revoke/guest-denial, builder-install/guest-denial, and revoked-moderator-denial cases with journal-attribution assertions (oracle: the journal entries recorded by a capturing journal). Full `id` package suite verified on the laptop.\n\nPhase 3 (joined-session frames, `actor_denied` wire code, Wasm-only builder installs) remains and is tracked as a follow-up on #5544.\n\nQueue: task 9611, lane code-w.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796813639&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8034&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8034&signature=9be8ae72ab8108d194d272fe646f0005b116e60a8e8cd1568b72cfc146d9cf90\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/co